      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "RBI was established on April 1, 1935, under the RBI Act, 1934, upon recommendations of the Hilton Young Commission.",
        "Understand the key difference between Cash Reserve Ratio (CRR, kept with RBI in cash) and Statutory Liquidity Ratio (SLR, kept with self in approved securities).",
        "Questions frequently test the definitions of Repo Rate (lending rate to banks) and Reverse Repo Rate (borrowing rate from banks)."
